:{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We will now show you summarized version of a real petition, which the AI has identified based on...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"We will now show you summarized version of a <b>real petition<\/b>, which the AI has identified based on the theory you provided at the beginning of this experiment.&nbsp;<br><br>On the next page, you will have the chance to read the summary, indicate whether you are willing to sign the petition, and then you will be provided with a chance to sign it.&nbsp;<br>","DataExportTag":"Q143","QuestionID":"QID143"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_39IRNTCn5hF9YDs","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID157","SecondaryAttribute":"We\u2019d like you to rate how you feel towards Democrats and Republicans on a scale of 0 to 100, whic.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Democrats"},"2":{"Display":"Republicans"}},"Configuration":{"CSSliderMax":100,"CSSliderMin":0,"CustomStart":true,"GridLines":10,"MobileFirst":true,"NotApplicable":false,"NumDecimals":"0","QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","ShowValue":true,"SnapToGrid":false,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5,"2":0.5}},"DataExportTag":"AffPol_Pre","DataVisibility":{"Hidden":false,"Private":false},"DefaultChoices":{"1":{"Value":"50"},"2":{"Value":"50"}},"GradingData":[],"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Cold"},"2":{"Display":"Warm"}},"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":3,"NextChoiceId":3,"QuestionDescription":"We\u2019d like you to rate how you feel towards Democrats and Republicans on a scale of 0 to 100, whic...","QuestionID":"QID157","QuestionText":"We\u2019d like you to rate how you feel towards Democrats and Republicans on a scale of 0 to 100, which we call a \u201cfeeling thermometer\u201d.&nbsp;\n<div><br>\nOn this feeling thermometer scale, ratings between 0 and 49 degrees mean that you feel unfavorable and cold (with 0 being the most unfavorable\/coldest).<br>\n<br>\nRatings between 51 and 100 degrees mean that you feel favorable and warm (with 100 being the most favorable\/warmest). A rating of 50 means you have no feelings one way or the other.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><b>How would you rate your feeling toward these groups<\/b>?&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>Remember we are asking you to rate ordinary people (e.g., voters) and not elected officials or candidates.<\/div>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"We\u2019d like you to rate how you feel towards Democrats and Republicans on a scale of 0 to 100, which we call a \u201cfeeling thermometer.\u201d&nbsp;<div>On this feeling thermometer scale, ratings between 0 and 49 degrees mean that you feel unfavorable and cold (with 0 being the most unfavorable\/coldest). Ratings between 51 and 100 degrees mean that you feel favorable and warm (with 100 being the most favorable\/warmest). A rating of 50 means you have no feelings one way or the other.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><b>How would you rate your feeling toward these groups<\/b>? Remember we are asking you to rate ordinary people (e.g., voters) and not elected officials or candidates.<\/div>","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_39IRNTCn5hF9YDs","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID163","SecondaryAttribute":"We\u2019d like you to rate how you feel towards Democrats and Republicans on a scale of 0 to 100, whic.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We&rsquo;d like you to rate how you feel towards Democrats and Republicans on a scale of 0 to 100, which we call a &ldquo;feeling thermometer&rdquo;.&nbsp;\n<div><br \/>\nOn this feeling thermometer scale, ratings between 0 and 49 degrees mean that you feel unfavorable and cold (with 0 being the most unfavorable\/coldest).<br \/>\n<br \/>\nRatings between 51 and 100 degrees mean that you feel favorable and warm (with 100 being the most favorable\/warmest). A rating of 50 means you have no feelings one way or the other.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><b>How would you rate your feeling toward these groups<\/b>?<br \/>\n<br \/>\nRemember we are asking you to rate ordinary people (e.g., voters) and not elected officials or candidates.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":{"1":{"Value":"50"},"2":{"Value":"50"}},"DataExportTag":"AffPol_Post","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":true,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true,"SliderStartPositions":{"1":0.5,"2":0.5}},"QuestionDescription":"We\u2019d like you to rate how you feel towards Democrats and Republicans on a scale of 0 to 100, whic...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Democrats"},"2":{"Display":"Republicans"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":3,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Cold"},"2":{"Display":"Warm"}},"QuestionID":"QID163"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_39IRNTCn5hF9YDs","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID112","SecondaryAttribute":"Were two news headlines visible on the previous page? (This part of the survey is still being per...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Were two news headlines visible on the previous page? <br><br>(This part of the survey is still being perfected, so it is possible the articles were not shown)&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"HeadlineCheck","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Were two news headlines visible on the previous page? (This part of the survey is stil